Official Website
&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If you would love to see the project yourself, feel free to check out the link here: &lt;a href="https://easypollvote.vercel.app" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://easypollvote.vercel.app&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I recommend to put a fake email and a fake name if you are using the app. &lt;strong&gt;Everything works as intended! Check it out and feedback is greatly appreciated!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

