&lt;li&gt;🔧 &lt;a href="https://www.mdatool.com/tools/sql-linter" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SQL Linter&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; — catch bugs in your NPI validation SQL before production&lt;/li&gt;
